{"id": "1541676398723473488", "channel_id": "1541676398723473488", "author_id": "229841460080541696", "author_name": "thegreenrobin", "content": "2.6 just released and i've noticed an instant difference in responsiveness, particularly in menus. There is now a noticeable lag whenever doing the most simple things like buying from the shop, dismantling covenants, rolling on banners and upgrading skills. My muscle memory for doing the dailies is not irrelavent because there's a huge amount of lag which makes buttons not register because they're waiting for a previous thing to finish happening. Is reduced performance a known issue?", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T05:11:36.418000+00:00", "thread_id": "1541676398723473488", "thread_title": "Steam Game Performance Noticeably Worse", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1361168893200044183"], "is_thread_starter": true}
